{
  "id": "its-always-sunny-in-philadelphia---9x06---the-gang-saves-the-day",
  "title": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 9x06 - The Gang Saves the Day",
  "sourceFilename": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 9x06 - The Gang Saves the Day.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-20T06:02:03.856Z",
  "lineCount": 272,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "This place has got the best hot dogs in Philadelphia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1563,
      "endMs": 5636
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Once you nosh on these, you're not gonna want to eat another hot dog after this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 5788,
      "endMs": 9611
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Might as well get some snacks while we're here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 9668,
      "endMs": 11424
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I'm getting a beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 11449,
      "endMs": 12505
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Don't grab a beer. We're on our way to a bar, which we own.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 12527,
      "endMs": 15225
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "I'm gonna get a beer, too. Are you serious?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 15263,
      "endMs": 17344
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Anyone else? Yeah, I'll have a beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 17363,
      "endMs": 18926
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Of course I want a beer. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 18946,
      "endMs": 20252
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "All right, well, I'm not gonna be the only one not drinking beer, so come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 20271,
      "endMs": 23282
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Don't move!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 23432,
      "endMs": 24579
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Oh, sh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 25333,
      "endMs": 26382
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Open the register. Open it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 26414,
      "endMs": 28435
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Oh, shit, oh, God, we're all gonna die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 28466,
      "endMs": 30385
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Put the money in the bag. Do it fast, or I'll blow your brains out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 31219,
      "endMs": 33963
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "What are we gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 34007,
      "endMs": 35558
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Sync & corrections by honeybunny www.addic7ed.com Resync for WEB-DL by Norther",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53957,
      "endMs": 63957
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Put the money in the bag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 66480,
      "endMs": 67724
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Do it fast, or I'll blow your brains out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67755,
      "endMs": 69449
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "What are we gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 69698,
      "endMs": 71521
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "I will shoot you in the teeth. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77696,
      "endMs": 79088
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Give me the money. Hey, bozo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79113,
      "endMs": 80840
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Walk away now, and I let you live... or stick around and repent for your sins.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81044,
      "endMs": 85647
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "You better step your ass back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85680,
      "endMs": 87438
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "And you better say \"cheese.\" Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87463,
      "endMs": 89972
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Crisis averted. Holy shit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 97728,
      "endMs": 100989
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Mac, that was amazing! Oh, my God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 101020,
      "endMs": 103114
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Did you like my \"say cheese\" line?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103234,
      "endMs": 104759
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "I didn't quite get that, if I'm being honest.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104804,
      "endMs": 106598
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Yeah, I was a little bit confused by that as well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106638,
      "endMs": 108571
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "It was a pun, 'cause I flung cheese in his face, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108591,
      "endMs": 110763
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "No, I got that, but... Yeah, but-but that's not really a pun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110789,
      "endMs": 113126
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "No, if you... if you had taken his photograph,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113151,
      "endMs": 114968
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "and then you flung cheese in his face... There it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 114993,
      "endMs": 116624
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "that would be a pun. - Yeah, you're taking the guy's picture, you say, \"Say cheese!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 116662,
      "endMs": 119225
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "That would've done it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119250,
      "endMs": 120194
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Should I go get a camera? You know what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120238,
      "endMs": 121704
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Yeah, he's missing the point. It doesn't matter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 121724,
      "endMs": 123682
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "What you just did was badass. Oh, my God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123707,
      "endMs": 126691
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Now let's take a look at who this scumbag is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126820,
      "endMs": 129489
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Oh, sh... oh, shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133836,
      "endMs": 135367
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Yakuza.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 135960,
      "endMs": 137285
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Go, go! Oh, shit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137329,
      "endMs": 138717
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Oh, my God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138753,
      "endMs": 140395
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Hyah! Hyoh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147080,
      "endMs": 148480
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Mac, watch out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216887,
      "endMs": 219088
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Hah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224483,
      "endMs": 227206
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Yah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227679,
      "endMs": 229923
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Hyah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229984,
      "endMs": 232318
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Very impressive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 250915,
      "endMs": 253311
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Your technique... is impeccable.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253336,
      "endMs": 257867
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Cool off. Oh my God, Mac, that was amazing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265947,
      "endMs": 268998
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "And that's a great pun, dude. You used the pun right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269300,
      "endMs": 271370
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Yeah, you got the pun right, dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271397,
      "endMs": 273017
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Huh? What pun?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273041,
      "endMs": 274654
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "The... \"Cool off\" and you kicked him in a fridge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 274703,
      "endMs": 276454
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "He's not getting it, is he? No, he's not. Forget it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276475,
      "endMs": 278241
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "What is a pun? Don't worry about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278274,
      "endMs": 279543
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "You know, move past it. I'll take his photograph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279571,
      "endMs": 281405
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "What the hell is the matter with you? Why would you do that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282980,
      "endMs": 286365
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "I killed the boss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286377,
      "endMs": 287465
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "That's not the boss, you idiot. He's my father!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287496,
      "endMs": 289987
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "He owns the store! Whoops.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289993,
      "endMs": 293037
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "My bad. Now, is your throat okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293053,
      "endMs": 294797
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Is it... is that from the smoke, or...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294818,
      "endMs": 296321
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Is that a pun?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296342,
      "endMs": 298310
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Oh, my God, Mac!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302839,
      "endMs": 304132
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304165,
      "endMs": 305307
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Mac, Mac, Mac. We're sorry for doubting your awesomeness. - Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305333,
      "endMs": 309317
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "I can't live without you. Don't die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309336,
      "endMs": 312003
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "I... don't... forgive you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 312032,
      "endMs": 319623
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322041,
      "endMs": 325035
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "No, no... Why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326409,
      "endMs": 328976
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329080,
      "endMs": 331843
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I love you! Why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331871,
      "endMs": 334672
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "I love you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334711,
      "endMs": 337928
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "God? Hello, Mac.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369624,
      "endMs": 372013
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Those were some pretty sweet moves.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372303,
      "endMs": 375422
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Thank you, my Lord and Savior.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375481,
      "endMs": 377106
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Won't you join me? Is that seat for me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 377127,
      "endMs": 380147
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "You're goddamn right it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 380461,
      "endMs": 383412
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Oh, hey, Rex. 'Sup, bro?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394134,
      "endMs": 396015
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "So what do we do now?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396372,
      "endMs": 397922
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Now we ignore everyone's prayers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397959,
      "endMs": 401264
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Put the money in the bag. Do it fast, or I'll blow your brains out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407140,
      "endMs": 410159
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "What are we gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410276,
      "endMs": 411665
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Damn it, Dee, this is all your fault. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417934,
      "endMs": 420022
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "It's because of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420053,
      "endMs": 420953
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "How is this my fault? It just is, you stupid bitch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420984,
      "endMs": 423372
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Guys, you thinking what I'm thinking? Let's sacrifice her. - What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 423397,
      "endMs": 426220
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Sir, sir! Please, take her, take her!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426242,
      "endMs": 428789
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Have your way with the whore!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428835,
      "endMs": 431482
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Oh. Let me blow these assholes away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435262,
      "endMs": 437675
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "No, no, wait, wait, wait, please, please! Please, don't shoot my friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 437700,
      "endMs": 440250
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Listen, listen to me. Just give me the gun, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440275,
      "endMs": 442555
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "We'll work something out. Just give me the gun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442577,
      "endMs": 444883
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Give it to me. There you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445429,
      "endMs": 447796
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Oh, Dee! Dee did it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448197,
      "endMs": 449657
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "You saved our lives! You saved the day!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449681,
      "endMs": 451334
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "You're the hero. I'll see you in hell, boners.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 451359,
      "endMs": 454513
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "No witnesses. I like your style.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461859,
      "endMs": 464612
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "We should team up. Us ladies need to stick together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464790,
      "endMs": 467772
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I tell you what.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467797,
      "endMs": 469290
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "I got your back. For life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469323,
      "endMs": 471913
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "She did it. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472787,
      "endMs": 474787
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "You bitch! You're dead!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 475140,
      "endMs": 477674
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "You hear me? Miss Reynolds?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478101,
      "endMs": 479676
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "We need to get you into the witness protection program immediately.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 479694,
      "endMs": 482783
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Let me ask. Are you good at playing characters?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483402,
      "endMs": 487123
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Hello, love, I'm the new butler.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497897,
      "endMs": 500489
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Albert Covington's the name. Is your mom about?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500508,
      "endMs": 504002
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "I'm sorry, their-their mother's no longer with us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504189,
      "endMs": 507124
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Oh, well, then, it looks like I've come at the right time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507220,
      "endMs": 511970
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Children, your chariot awaits.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513744,
      "endMs": 516788
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Ah, Miss Sarah, ham and cheese, no crust, just the way you like it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516919,
      "endMs": 521476
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Ah, ah, ah! Who slayed Achilles?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522261,
      "endMs": 524689
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Uh, Paris, Hector's brother. Well done, lad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524707,
      "endMs": 527887
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "An extra treat for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527917,
      "endMs": 530114
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Mr. Covington, have you seen my...? Briefcase, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530408,
      "endMs": 533414
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Oh, Mr. Covington.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533555,
      "endMs": 536064
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "You're the best, Mr. Covington.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536414,
      "endMs": 538700
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "How long are you staying with us?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538725,
      "endMs": 540297
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Well, Sarah, something tells me I'm gonna be here a long time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540330,
      "endMs": 544664
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Why is that? Your sweater's on backwards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544986,
      "endMs": 548028
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "♪ Paper plates for nana ♪ ♪ House is a mess ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 551913,
      "endMs": 553980
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "♪ Life for a single parent ♪ ♪ Is full of stress ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 554019,
      "endMs": 556703
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "♪ Makes you want to put a gun ♪ ♪ In your mouth ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 556733,
      "endMs": 559000
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "♪ Or get real high ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 559026,
      "endMs": 561486
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "♪ But with a little help I ♪ ♪ think we'll just get by. ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 561517,
      "endMs": 565002
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "By now, everyone knows the remarkable story of Dee Reynolds, a government witness whose turn as a British butler was so convincing that it was spun off into the highest rated sitcom of all time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568041,
      "endMs": 580526
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Today she is here to talk with us about her upcoming blockbuster Mother Earth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580582,
      "endMs": 586707
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Tell us more about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586861,
      "endMs": 588358
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Well, this time I play a very beautiful woman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588383,
      "endMs": 591127
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Uh, a warrior princess who saves the world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 591152,
      "endMs": 593656
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "It's already grossed over $900 million in presale tickets, but I don't care about that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 593681,
      "endMs": 598207
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "You know, I'm more interested in exploring truth through character.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598237,
      "endMs": 602126
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Amazing. Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602482,
      "endMs": 604266
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "And I understand you've recently become engaged to young heartthrob crooner Josh Groban.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 604633,
      "endMs": 610063
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "When I found out that Mr. Covington was actually a chick, yeah, I had to have her. I mean, look at her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611287,
      "endMs": 616881
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "She's smart, she's sexy, she's hilarious.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 616899,
      "endMs": 619210
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "She pops.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620269,
      "endMs": 621588
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "He likes his ladies to pop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621600,
      "endMs": 623175
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "That's true, Groban does like his ladies to pop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623200,
      "endMs": 626002
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Isn't he cute? Sing her that song you wrote for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626333,
      "endMs": 628805
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Which one? The one you wrote for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628824,
      "endMs": 630212
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Oh, God, put me on the spot. It's great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 630232,
      "endMs": 632048
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Oh, you're gonna love it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 632083,
      "endMs": 633899
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "♪ She's got blonde hair ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 633992,
      "endMs": 637076
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "♪ She's perfect in every way ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 637097,
      "endMs": 639366
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "♪ Feet not too large ♪ ♪ Not too small ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 639394,
      "endMs": 643429
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "♪ Blonde hair ♪ ♪ She's gorgeous ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 643454,
      "endMs": 646179
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "♪ Not like a bird ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 646385,
      "endMs": 648699
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "♪ But like a beautiful woman ♪ ♪ Definitely not like a bird. ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 648731,
      "endMs": 654232
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654452,
      "endMs": 656125
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "I love this man so much.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656881,
      "endMs": 658469
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Tell you what.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 658800,
      "endMs": 660143
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "I've got the feeling we're gonna be together a long time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660568,
      "endMs": 665357
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "That's how babies are made.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666751,
      "endMs": 669027
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "But they didn't stay together a long time, their marriage only lasting a shocking 17 minutes before Reynolds met a new man whom she claimed she had to have.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670113,
      "endMs": 680692
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "I'll shoot you in the teeth. Give me the money!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684058,
      "endMs": 686497
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Put the money in the bag. Do it fast, or I'll blow your brains out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691786,
      "endMs": 694914
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "What are we gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695016,
      "endMs": 697246
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Give me the money!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702853,
      "endMs": 703790
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "You're going about this all wrong, friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704061,
      "endMs": 706165
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Oh, what the hell do you know? More than you think.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 706193,
      "endMs": 709470
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "A fisherman always spots another fisherman from afar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709913,
      "endMs": 712628
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Hard candy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714652,
      "endMs": 716861
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Shit. Ah, ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717498,
      "endMs": 720104
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "I... I dares it... I dar-dar-dar... A crammy hand...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 720173,
      "endMs": 725023
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "A crammy handle bit. A crammy handle bit aye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725064,
      "endMs": 728745
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Der.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729754,
      "endMs": 730950
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "I love you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735660,
      "endMs": 737056
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Oh, God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737241,
      "endMs": 738918
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "I...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739962,
      "endMs": 741373
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "I...am...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741397,
      "endMs": 742992
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "I...am... God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743017,
      "endMs": 744696
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "I think he's awake. His eyes keep opening.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755236,
      "endMs": 757467
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Ah, I don't know, man. He looks weird.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757511,
      "endMs": 759710
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Can he hear us? No way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 759743,
      "endMs": 761856
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "His eggs are scrambled.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761947,
      "endMs": 763813
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Mr. Reynolds, are you there?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763838,
      "endMs": 766045
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Blink if you can understand me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 767699,
      "endMs": 771123
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Where am I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772859,
      "endMs": 774147
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "You were shot in the head during an armed robbery.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774172,
      "endMs": 777042
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "The bullet narrowly missed your brain stem and exited the back of your skull.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777067,
      "endMs": 781787
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Does-does my dick work?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781810,
      "endMs": 785816
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 786035,
      "endMs": 787191
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Your penis does not work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787234,
      "endMs": 789230
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Kill me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789255,
      "endMs": 791897
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Mr. Reynolds, Mr. Reynolds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792353,
      "endMs": 794934
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "It's important that you maintain a positive attitude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795309,
      "endMs": 797978
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Now, with a lot of hard work and the support of your friends...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 798003,
      "endMs": 802109
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Ah, it appears they've left. Well, not to worry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 802134,
      "endMs": 805202
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "We have a top-notch rehabilitation staff and they're gonna do everything they can to improve your quality of life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 805497,
      "endMs": 811251
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "In fact, here comes your nurse now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 811282,
      "endMs": 814750
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "♪ Until now ♪ ♪ I always got by on my own ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 815169,
      "endMs": 821142
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "♪ I never really cared ♪ ♪ Until I met you... ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 821170,
      "endMs": 825398
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Hello, Dennis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 825743,
      "endMs": 827525
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "...from the Channel Five News weather team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 830944,
      "endMs": 834534
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Once upon a time, yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834557,
      "endMs": 836388
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "But I left that to do something more meaningful with my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836414,
      "endMs": 839326
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Now, what do you say we get you back on your feet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839639,
      "endMs": 842341
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "The forecast calls for sunshine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842385,
      "endMs": 847109
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Come on, come on, come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849275,
      "endMs": 851387
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Yes. More.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852654,
      "endMs": 854596
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "I can't do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 856763,
      "endMs": 859182
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "That's it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 861144,
      "endMs": 863144
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Use your strength. That's right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863351,
      "endMs": 865196
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "You're so strong. That's it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865197,
      "endMs": 867525
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867558,
      "endMs": 869027
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "♪ And I just can't ♪ ♪ wait till the day ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 869062,
      "endMs": 870988
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "♪ When you knock on my door... ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 871008,
      "endMs": 873055
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Oh, I'm so proud of you, yes! Oh, my God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873080,
      "endMs": 875530
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "♪ Now, every time I go for the mailbox ♪ ♪ Gotta hold myself down... ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 877394,
      "endMs": 881261
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Yes! Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881297,
      "endMs": 883583
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Ah, yes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883631,
      "endMs": 885537
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "♪ 'Cause I just can't wait ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 885561,
      "endMs": 887306
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "♪ Till you write me ♪ ♪ You're coming around... ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 887323,
      "endMs": 891874
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Yes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892661,
      "endMs": 893955
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Yes. Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895848,
      "endMs": 897934
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Yeah, Jackie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898205,
      "endMs": 899937
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Oh... This is so great. I need to tell you something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899972,
      "endMs": 902133
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Okay. I am in love with you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902157,
      "endMs": 904644
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "♪ I'm walking on sunshine ♪ ♪ Whoa... ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 911165,
      "endMs": 915540
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "She's lucky to be alive. She broke her arm, few ribs, punctured a lung, shattered her pelvis...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915723,
      "endMs": 921858
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Compound fractures in both legs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 922044,
      "endMs": 924944
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Her breasts? Excuse me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925837,
      "endMs": 928225
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "What about her breasts?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 929581,
      "endMs": 931530
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "I'm afraid that they were, um... obliterated.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932781,
      "endMs": 936758
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Believe me, we did everything in our power to try to save them, but...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936937,
      "endMs": 940575
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Now, look, she has a long, difficult road ahead of her, but you above all people should know that anything is possible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941035,
      "endMs": 947581
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "She is lucky to have you in her life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 947787,
      "endMs": 950697
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Could you give us a moment, please? Of course.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 952471,
      "endMs": 956131
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "♪ I'm walking on sunshine ♪ ♪ Whoa ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 970761,
      "endMs": 974887
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "♪ I'm walking on sunshine ♪ ♪ Whoa ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 974986,
      "endMs": 979321
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "♪ I'm walking on sunshine ♪ ♪ Whoa ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 979497,
      "endMs": 982928
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "♪ And don't it feel good ♪ ♪ Good All right... ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 984125,
      "endMs": 987331
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Rest easy, my angel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987356,
      "endMs": 989712
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Put the money in the bag. Do it fast, or I'll blow your brains out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996662,
      "endMs": 999713
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "What are we gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999732,
      "endMs": 1001607
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Let's go, buddy. Today!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005709,
      "endMs": 1007322
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Everybody stay calm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007356,
      "endMs": 1008981
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "I'll handle this. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009006,
      "endMs": 1010740
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "No, Frank. Hey, Stop it. Frank, don't be... Are you crazy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010771,
      "endMs": 1013424
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Hey, what are you doing? Hurry up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1013447,
      "endMs": 1015780
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Move faster, or I'll shoot you in the face.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016997,
      "endMs": 1019753
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "In the bag. In the bag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1020463,
      "endMs": 1022530
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "I'm gonna shoot you if you don't move faster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022770,
      "endMs": 1024759
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Let's go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1025223,
      "endMs": 1026467
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Okay... I don't have all day. Come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028260,
      "endMs": 1030027
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "You're surrounded. Put your weapon down and come out with your hands up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031678,
      "endMs": 1035077
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "You're gonna have to kill me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035096,
      "endMs": 1036377
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "All right, send in the K-9.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038191,
      "endMs": 1040240
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Oh, get him off me! Goddamn it, stop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042762,
      "endMs": 1045632
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Whoa, easy, puppy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1045660,
      "endMs": 1047860
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "All right, the girl's dead. But we can still save the others.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050090,
      "endMs": 1053046
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Mmm...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062080,
      "endMs": 1064018
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "I will shoot you in the teeth. Give me the money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064493,
      "endMs": 1066682
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066714,
      "endMs": 1067646
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Put the money in the bag. Do it fast, or I'll blow your brains out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072832,
      "endMs": 1076032
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Put the money in the bag. Do it fast, or I'll blow your brains out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1082981,
      "endMs": 1086173
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Waitress, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086796,
      "endMs": 1088346
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "You dick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090407,
      "endMs": 1091763
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Come on!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091787,
      "endMs": 1093616
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Oh, my God, Charlie, that was so brave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094372,
      "endMs": 1097166
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Anything for you, my love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1097191,
      "endMs": 1099379
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Charlie. What are you doing, dude?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1261843,
      "endMs": 1263704
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Huh? Nothing. What are you doing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1263746,
      "endMs": 1265566
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Will you focus? We're in a serious situation here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1265592,
      "endMs": 1267593
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "What are we gonna do, you guys? Are you thinking what I'm thinking?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1267619,
      "endMs": 1270936
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1273320,
      "endMs": 1274847
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "What the...? The big bills, underneath. Give me the big bills.",
